        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "entrana:17a6icv",
          "html": "Bank everything that you are <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Entrana#Equipment_on_Entrana\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">not allowed to take to Entrana</a>, and ensure you keep the large pouch in your inventory.",
